  - [ ] Nutrition: how to organize the food you eat, according to many different diets. With steps on how to plant/acquire it (scanning possible vendors around you with Transfer proposals if you want it), treat it, and cook it, separating into several portions, reading data from your measurements to determine the amount of your Needs of certain foods and what you must avoid due to alergies (one shoudl use a Medical Lingua Vocabulary, to read your records of alergies and have the exact term of an alergy the Trail can query to cancel the recommendation and alert you of things you should avoid, avoid eating together, avoid eating at all if it even may contain something you can ingest due to a processing error). This was slopped and it was deleted in commit 'a143edf', 2026-07-18. This is an AI summary of it:
    Rules follow Brazil's current Ministry of Health food guide.
  ```json
  {
    "id": "builtin:arroz-integral",
